{
    "title": "Puzzle Adventure: Mystery Tale",
    "description": "New mystery solving adventure game, full of unique puzzles and logic riddles. Find hidden artifacts, treasures and crystals, explore supernatural world full of monsters, beasts, paranormal creatures & hidden enchanted objects. Unravel spooky mysteries, escape from scary monsters and start solving murders & crimes.\r\n\r\nBecome a detective, investigate stories & solve cases connected to unique characters, monsters or beasts. Werewolves, ghosts, scary events & secrets await you in this mystery puzzle adventure game. Solve logic puzzles, find hidden objects and treasures and escape tombs. Solve challenging puzzles and mysteries of the scary world.\r\n\r\nUpgrade your adventure camp, collect energy and solve mystery. Puzzles, riddles & magical artifacts will help you progress in this new mystery adventure. Travel through beautiful 3D locations, supernatural world, secret tombs and find enchanted objects hidden in scary locations full of ghosts, monsters and other mysterious scary creatures.\r\n\r\nPuzzle Adventure features:\r\n\u25b6 Explore supernatural world full of mystery puzzle & riddles\r\n\u25b6 Find clues, follow them, solve puzzles and collect the rewards and magical objects\r\n\u25b6 Become an official detective for scary mysteries\r\n\u25b6 Communicate with spooky magical monsters\r\n\u25b6 Solve mystery & scary crimes and murders\r\n\u25b6 Explore beautiful and magical locations filled with adventurous mystery quests & puzzles\r\n\u25b6 Help your uncle and other characters to catch monsters and ghosts\r\n\u25b6 Upgrade your camp to progress through puzzles and adventure faster\r\nPrepare to solve the best mystery puzzle adventure you ever played. Scary quests and secrets, detective work, magical monsters and beings and unique characters set in a spooky puzzle adventure story.\r\nPLEASE NOTE! Puzzle Adventure is an online free game to download and play that requires a network connection to play. Some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. If you don't want to use this feature please disable in-app purchases in your device's settings.\r\n\r\nDo you have any suggestions or problems in your adventure? Our caring community managers would love to hear from you, visit https://care.pxfd.co/puzzleadventure!\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: http://pxfd.co/eula\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://pxfd.co/privacy\r\n\r\nDo you enjoy our mystery puzzle game? Follow @PuzzleAdventure on social media to get the latest news and updates.",
    "descriptionHTML": "New mystery solving adventure game, full of unique puzzles and logic riddles. Find hidden artifacts, treasures and crystals, explore supernatural world full of monsters, beasts, paranormal creatures &amp; hidden enchanted objects. Unravel spooky mysteries, escape from scary monsters and start solving murders &amp; crimes.<br><br>Become a detective, investigate stories &amp; solve cases connected to unique characters, monsters or beasts. Werewolves, ghosts, scary events &amp; secrets await you in this mystery puzzle adventure game. Solve logic puzzles, find hidden objects and treasures and escape tombs. Solve challenging puzzles and mysteries of the scary world.<br><br>Upgrade your adventure camp, collect energy and solve mystery. Puzzles, riddles &amp; magical artifacts will help you progress in this new mystery adventure. Travel through beautiful 3D locations, supernatural world, secret tombs and find enchanted objects hidden in scary locations full of ghosts, monsters and other mysterious scary creatures.<br><br>Puzzle Adventure features:<br>\u25b6 Explore supernatural world full of mystery puzzle &amp; riddles<br>\u25b6 Find clues, follow them, solve puzzles and collect the rewards and magical objects<br>\u25b6 Become an official detective for scary mysteries<br>\u25b6 Communicate with spooky magical monsters<br>\u25b6 Solve mystery &amp; scary crimes and murders<br>\u25b6 Explore beautiful and magical locations filled with adventurous mystery quests &amp; puzzles<br>\u25b6 Help your uncle and other characters to catch monsters and ghosts<br>\u25b6 Upgrade your camp to progress through puzzles and adventure faster<br>Prepare to solve the best mystery puzzle adventure you ever played. Scary quests and secrets, detective work, magical monsters and beings and unique characters set in a spooky puzzle adventure story.<br>PLEASE NOTE! Puzzle Adventure is an online free game to download and play that requires a network connection to play. Some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. If you don&#39;t want to use this feature please disable in-app purchases in your device&#39;s settings.<br><br>Do you have any suggestions or problems in your adventure? Our caring community managers would love to hear from you, visit https://care.pxfd.co/puzzleadventure!<br><br>Terms of Use: http://pxfd.co/eula<br>Privacy Policy: http://pxfd.co/privacy<br><br>Do you enjoy our mystery puzzle game? Follow @PuzzleAdventure on social media to get the latest news and updates.",
